\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30002840 (OWR-13673-010). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Subfactors and Conformal Field Theory (2015), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2015/16, pp. 849--926. Primary report accessed 2026-10-11; relevant PDF pages 35, 36.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2015/16}.
\item[S3] Grossman--Izumi--Snyder, Asaeda--Haagerup categories (catalogue-listed context; not independently consulted in this preparation).
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1501.07324}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30002840}

